+++
+++The fc projection dominates: AR head W4A4 costs only −0.18, while any projection
+++W4A4 costs −1.4..−2.1. **projection_first is the single most damaging component**
+++(−2.00 alone ≈ both −2.14 ≈ full −2.14).
