+++flowchart LR
+++    T[target<br/>emits h] --> C[fc concat e,h]
+++    E[draft embed e] --> C
+++    C --> L[draft layer] --> F[feature f]
+++    F -->|recycle f| C
+++    F --> H[original lm_head] --> K[top-k tokens]
