+++"""Shared fixtures for the B2 split-projection test suite.
+++
+++Pure-CPU fp64: random orthogonal R1 (QR), random positive gamma, and a TINY
+++real EAGLE-1 cnets.Model (the actual vendored class, hidden=64) so the chain
